003_1_06_e_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_06_e_33","text":"Is it just to win the competition?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_06_e_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce_003_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_06_e_34","text":"Of course I really want to win the competition, but...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_06_e_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce_003_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_06_e_35","text":"when we first got here, we were so discombobulated, and you all were so nice to us.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_06_e_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce_003_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_06_e_36","text":"I realize this is hardly enough to repay you, but nevertheless, I wanted to make it as delicious as possible.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_06_e_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_06_e_37","text":"!!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_06_e_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce_003_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_06_e_38","text":"I wanted to take first place so I could head back to Lugunica and also repay you all for your kindness, all using the very same delicious dish. Perhaps I was overreaching...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_06_e_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_06_e_39","text":"Ha, don't worry.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_06_e_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_06_e_40","text":"Emilia, this is my final piece of advice.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_06_e_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_06_e_41","text":"When you're cooking, you need to think about various factors.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_06_e_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_06_e_42","text":"It's especially important to think of who will be eating your food.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_06_e_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_06_e_43","text":"If you think of that person and put your heart and soul into it as you're cooking, you'll end up with a delicious meal every single time.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_06_e_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce_003_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_06_e_44","text":"Put your heart and soul into it...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_06_e_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce_003_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_06_e_45","text":"I think I know what you mean.","jump":null,"exit":false,"ente